  SK = kdf(N_A,N_B), both answer Attentively (compute_behavior), the ceremony finishes and the two
  keys agree. The unperturbed run the failure profiles perturb.
  Run: check.py --prove ceremonies/alex_blake_kdf/P0_baseline.spthy
*/

// -- crypto + framework --
